WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.623
DENSE_RANK also gives tied values the same rank But
it does

00:00:05.636 --> 00:00:11.220
not leave gaps If two employees tie for second the
next distinct

00:00:11.246 --> 00:00:16.754
salary gets rank three This is often useful for
grouping distinct

00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:17.662
ordered levels
